    "detailed_description": "Join Jean, the second princess of Elden, as she navigates her kingdom through a time of upheaval and uncovers a sinister conspiracy. Set in Ultiria\u2014a continent of five diverse kingdoms\u2014this story unfolds 30 years after a failed senatorial uprising. Although peace was restored, new threats now loom over Jean\u2019s kingdom.<br>Struggling with academics but excelling in combat, Jean faces a critical challenge when bandits invade Elden. Accompanied by her elder sister, Crown Princess Justine, Jean embarks on a mission that will lead to unforeseen and far-reaching consequences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136890/extras/2157fc6083114a864267af8f242b60d8.poster.avif?t=1725512530\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136890/extras/2157fc6083114a864267af8f242b60d8.webm?t=1725512530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136890/extras/2157fc6083114a864267af8f242b60d8.mp4?t=1725512530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Gameplay and Features:<br><br>Chronicles of Ultiria is a traditional strategy RPG that requires you to master a range of characters and strategic elements for victory. Navigate complex grid-based maps, battle enemy forces, and uncover the schemes of the shadowy Ultiran Emperor.<br><br>\u25c6 Strategic Use of Magic and Support Abilities<br>Deploy various magic spells to debuff enemies, enhance your defenses with shields, and use staves for healing or providing buffs to allies. Utilize these abilities to create tactical advantages, strengthen your party, and disrupt your foes\u2019 strategies.<br><br>\u25c6 Unleash Powerful Combat Arts<br>Execute devastating combat arts to gain a crucial edge in battle. Using axes to overpower your enemies or lances to avoid getting counter-attacked, these arts can turn the tide of combat in your favor. Master these techniques to outmaneuver and defeat your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136890/extras/df8fa4d2ea7077538e63e7a48c30f1e2.poster.avif?t=1725512530\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136890/extras/df8fa4d2ea7077538e63e7a48c30f1e2.webm?t=1725512530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136890/extras/df8fa4d2ea7077538e63e7a48c30f1e2.mp4?t=1725512530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key Features:<br>\u25c6Save at the start of each turn for strategic flexibility.<br>\u25c618 meticulously crafted maps with diverse terrains and objectives.<br>\u25c626 unique playable characters with personal skills.<br>\u25c620 different classes from branching promotion paths.<br>\u25c67 distinct weapon types and over 40 unique weapons.<br>\u25c6Permanent unit death adds gravity to every decision.<br><br>Prepare to lead, strategize, and uncover dark secrets in Chronicles of Ultiria. The fate of Elden and beyond rests in your hands.",
    "about_the_game": "Join Jean, the second princess of Elden, as she navigates her kingdom through a time of upheaval and uncovers a sinister conspiracy. Set in Ultiria\u2014a continent of five diverse kingdoms\u2014this story unfolds 30 years after a failed senatorial uprising. Although peace was restored, new threats now loom over Jean\u2019s kingdom.<br>Struggling with academics but excelling in combat, Jean faces a critical challenge when bandits invade Elden. Accompanied by her elder sister, Crown Princess Justine, Jean embarks on a mission that will lead to unforeseen and far-reaching consequences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136890/extras/2157fc6083114a864267af8f242b60d8.poster.avif?t=1725512530\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136890/extras/2157fc6083114a864267af8f242b60d8.webm?t=1725512530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136890/extras/2157fc6083114a864267af8f242b60d8.mp4?t=1725512530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Gameplay and Features:<br><br>Chronicles of Ultiria is a traditional strategy RPG that requires you to master a range of characters and strategic elements for victory. Navigate complex grid-based maps, battle enemy forces, and uncover the schemes of the shadowy Ultiran Emperor.<br><br>\u25c6 Strategic Use of Magic and Support Abilities<br>Deploy various magic spells to debuff enemies, enhance your defenses with shields, and use staves for healing or providing buffs to allies. Utilize these abilities to create tactical advantages, strengthen your party, and disrupt your foes\u2019 strategies.<br><br>\u25c6 Unleash Powerful Combat Arts<br>Execute devastating combat arts to gain a crucial edge in battle. Using axes to overpower your enemies or lances to avoid getting counter-attacked, these arts can turn the tide of combat in your favor. Master these techniques to outmaneuver and defeat your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136890/extras/df8fa4d2ea7077538e63e7a48c30f1e2.poster.avif?t=1725512530\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136890/extras/df8fa4d2ea7077538e63e7a48c30f1e2.webm?t=1725512530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136890/extras/df8fa4d2ea7077538e63e7a48c30f1e2.mp4?t=1725512530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key Features:<br>\u25c6Save at the start of each turn for strategic flexibility.<br>\u25c618 meticulously crafted maps with diverse terrains and objectives.<br>\u25c626 unique playable characters with personal skills.<br>\u25c620 different classes from branching promotion paths.<br>\u25c67 distinct weapon types and over 40 unique weapons.<br>\u25c6Permanent unit death adds gravity to every decision.<br><br>Prepare to lead, strategize, and uncover dark secrets in Chronicles of Ultiria. The fate of Elden and beyond rests in your hands.",
    "short_description": "Chronicles of Ultiria is a classic strategy RPG where you command a diverse cast of characters through turn and grid-based battles. Strategize to overcome enemies, traverse dangerous maps, and unravel the dark plots of the Ultiran Emperor.",
